<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CA1002;CA1008;CA1819;CA1721;CA2227;CS1591;CA1024;CA1062;CA1305;CA1502</NoWarn>
    
    <!-- Package Information -->
    <PackageId>MimeCheck</PackageId>
    <Version>2.0.0</Version>
    <Authors>Vijay Pratap Singh</Authors>
    <Company>MimeCheck</Company>
    <Product>MimeCheck</Product>
    <Description>A comprehensive MIME type validation library for .NET. Detect and validate file types using magic byte signatures with support for 50+ file formats including images, documents, archives, audio/video, and executables. Includes ASP.NET Core integration with validation attributes, middleware, and dependency injection support.</Description>
    <PackageTags>mime;mimetype;file-validation;magic-bytes;file-type;content-type;security;aspnetcore;file-upload;validation</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
v2.0.0 — MIME string validation (additive, fully backwards-compatible)

Added:
- MimeValidator.IsKnownMimeType(string) and GetKnownMimeTypes() — validate user-supplied MIME-type strings against canonical types, their aliases, and signature-less types. Case- and whitespace-insensitive.
- MimeSignature.Aliases (optional string[]) — alternate MIME names co-located with byte signatures (e.g. text/xml, image/jpg, application/x-zip-compressed, audio/mp3). Recognized by IsKnownMimeType but never returned by the detector.
- SignatureDatabase.GetAllMimeTypesIncludingAliases().
- MimeTypes constants: TextXml, Csv, Markdown, Yaml, XHtml, JsonLd, FormUrlEncoded, MultipartFormData.

Unchanged:
- MimeDetector.Detect continues to return canonical MIME types only.
- MimeValidator.GetSupportedMimeTypes() continues to return only bytes-detectable types.
- All existing constants, validation pipelines, AspNetCore middleware, attributes, and services are byte-for-byte compatible with 1.x.

Full changelog: https://github.com/vijaypratap12/MimeCheck/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/vijaypratap12/MimeCheck</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/vijaypratap12/MimeCheck</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    
    <!-- Build Settings -->
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>false</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    
    <!-- Package Settings -->
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- Include README and LICENSE in package from root folder -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- Exclude sample files from package -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="Controllers\**" />
    <Compile Remove="Program.cs" />
    <Content Remove="appsettings*.json" />
    <Content Remove="Properties\**" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- ASP.NET Core framework reference -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <FrameworkReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.App" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- Source Link for debugging -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub" Version="8.0.0" PrivateAssets="All" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
